    "StockRole": "Superheavy LAM",
    "YangsThoughts": "This thing should be impossible, it's way too heavy for flying around. It's not even supposed to be possible to put a jump jet onto a mech this heavy, but somehow those Blakists managed it. That RAC/20 is a monster as well, able to obliterate a lot of smaller mechs in one volley, though with that heat output, you'll be lucky to be able to sustain that fire."
